<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Cook returns four weeks after starting hydrochlorothiazide 25 mg, amlodipine 5 mg, atorvastatin 40 mg and aspirin 81 mg. He has missed no doses. He urinates more in the mornings but has no dizziness on standing, cramps, ankle swelling, muscle aches, indigestion or bruising. His home readings over the past week average 136/82. He has had no stroke symptoms. He had the echocardiogram this morning. He signed a weekly lease for his room and is waiting for his benefits decision. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Home blood pressure</td><td>Average 136/82 over the past week</td></tr><tr><td>Medicine effects</td><td>More morning urination; no dizziness, cramps, swelling, muscle aches or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Stroke symptoms</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Social</td><td>Room settled; benefits decision pending</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

